                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dawson to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-07-31"><hi rendition="#italic">July 31,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Dawson reports that vigorous steps have been taken in the Thomsen
                    inheritance tax case by Minister Bryan.)</p>
            </div>
